queens-game

Based on the LinkedIn Queens game

Rules may be found [here](https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/a6269510)

Goals of this project:

1. Create a script that takes in a matrix representing the empty Queens grid and outputs a solved grid.

2. Create a script that takes an integer as input n and outputs a solvable n by n queens grid.

3. Create a deployable web UI that contains an interactive queens grid

4. Integrate the game generation script with the UI to allow new games to generate given a grid dimension n.

5. Add functionality to the web UI to allow upload or capture of an external Queens grid (empty or partly solved) and outputs the solution